{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_testing_nuke_build", "label": "Nuke build orchestration", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#build-orchestration-with-nuke", "source_url": "https://github.com/The-Running-Dev/SubZeroDev.WinGet/blob/main/build/Build.cs", "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A thin generic layer over the same dotnet commands so CI calls targets instead of hand-written steps; build/_build.csproj targets net10.0 because Nuke.Common 10.x ships lib/net10.0 only, while the product stays on net8, and the build.ps1/build.sh bootstrappers are required because the Nuke global tool locates a build by searching for them."}, {"id": "docs_testing_unit_tests", "label": "Mocked unit test suite", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#unit-tests", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "100 tests with zero COM dependency so they run anywhere in ~200ms, covering the service layer, CLI argument-building contracts, winget pin list parsing variants, model defaults, DI registration, and the exception type."}, {"id": "docs_testing_integration_tests", "label": "Live integration tests", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#live-integration-tests", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "12 NUnit [Explicit] tests excluded from plain dotnet test; deliberately read-only because they run against whatever machine executes them, with mutating coverage tracked pending a disposable side-effect-free test package."}, {"id": "docs_testing_coverage", "label": "Coverage reporting (coverlet + ReportGenerator)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#coverage", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Unit-only 27.7% line vs 54% merged with a live integration run; the uncovered remainder is COM-operation internals that only execute during real mutating operations. Method coverage is not quoted because ReportGenerator 5.5.x gates that metric behind sponsorship."}, {"id": "docs_testing_ci_workflow", "label": "GitHub Actions build workflow", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#continuous-integration", "source_url": "https://github.com/The-Running-Dev/SubZeroDev.WinGet/blob/main/.github/workflows/build.yml", "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two jobs on windows-latest: build runs on every push to main and every PR as the required status check (single `nuke Test Coverage` invocation so the shared Restore/Compile/Test chain runs once, since Nuke only de-duplicates within one invocation), and release (needs: build) does all packing/publishing. Both check out full history, but only release truly needs it for [GitVersion]; build uses fetch-depth 0 solely to silence Nuke's eager-injection warning."}, {"id": "docs_testing_gitversion", "label": "GitVersion versioning", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#where-the-version-comes-from", "source_url": "https://gitversion.net/", "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Derives the version from git history rather than the .csproj <Version>; GitVersion.yml's next-version sets the base because without it GitVersion inferred 0.0.1. Per-branch deployment-mode overrides made no difference \u2014 an untagged commit is always a prerelease, which is why a stable release requires a v* tag."}, {"id": "docs_testing_publish_github_packages", "label": "PublishGitHubPackages target", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#github-packages-automatic", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Automatic: a push to main publishes a distinct prerelease, a v* tag publishes stable. Uses the automatic GITHUB_TOKEN so no secret is needed, and --skip-duplicate makes re-pushing an existing version harmless. The workflow's push trigger must include tags: ['v*'], because with only branches: declared GitHub never runs the workflow for tag pushes and the tag would silently publish nothing."}, {"id": "docs_testing_publish_nuget", "label": "PublishNuGet target (manual)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#nugetorg-manual", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Off by default; runs only on a manual workflow_dispatch with push_to_nuget checked and a NUGET_API_KEY secret, and publishes the .csproj-pinned version rather than the GitVersion one."}, {"id": "docs_testing_running_ci_locally", "label": "Running CI locally with act", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#running-ci-locally", "source_url": "https://github.com/nektos/act", "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Host mode is required because the job targets Windows, and it reuses the real environment so the installed Nuke global tool persists between runs; the workflow uses dotnet tool update, which is idempotent, so repeat act runs don't fail."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_testing_nuke_build", "target": "docs_testing_unit_tests", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#build-orchestration-with-nuke", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_testing_nuke_build", "target": "docs_testing_integration_tests", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#build-orchestration-with-nuke", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_testing_nuke_build", "target": "docs_testing_coverage", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#coverage", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_testing_nuke_build", "target": "docs_testing_publish_github_packages", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#build-orchestration-with-nuke", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_testing_nuke_build", "target": "docs_testing_publish_nuget", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#build-orchestration-with-nuke", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_testing_ci_workflow", "target": "docs_testing_nuke_build", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#continuous-integration", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_testing_ci_workflow", "target": "docs_testing_coverage", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#continuous-integration", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_testing_publish_github_packages", "target": "docs_testing_gitversion", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#github-packages-automatic", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_testing_ci_workflow", "target": "docs_testing_gitversion", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#continuous-integration", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_testing_publish_github_packages", "target": "docs_getting_started_github_packages_feed", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#github-packages-automatic", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_testing_running_ci_locally", "target": "docs_testing_ci_workflow", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#running-ci-locally", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_testing_unit_tests", "target": "docs_usage_packages_retry_policy", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#unit-tests", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_testing_unit_tests", "target": "docs_usage_pins_export_import_getpins", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#unit-tests", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_testing_unit_tests", "target": "docs_getting_started_addpackagemanagement", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#unit-tests", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_testing_integration_tests", "target": "docs_usage_pins_export_import_export", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#live-integration-tests", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_testing_integration_tests", "target": "docs_usage_sources_getsources", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#live-integration-tests", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_testing_coverage", "target": "docs_architecture_wingetfactory", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#coverage", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_testing_coverage", "target": "docs_architecture_hosting_caveats", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#coverage", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_testing_nuke_build", "target": "docs_getting_started_platform_pinning", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/testing.md", "source_location": "docs/testing.md#building", "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}